Package: CausalMultiOmics
Title: Validation and Preprocessing Planning for Multi-Block Omics Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("First", "Last", , "first.last@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for auditing multi-block datasets before integration.
    Data blocks of any modality (omics, imaging, clinical, environmental)
    are collected into a single container, screened for structural and
    distributional problems, and profiled block by block. A battery of
    candidate transformations is benchmarked for each block and an
    automatic preprocessing recipe is derived from the result, together
    with a quality score, quality-control checks, diagnostic plots and a
    self-contained HTML report.
